  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.7 - Bug Fixes\n\n**Bug Fixes:**\n- Fixed: GetMemberAttachmentsAsync failed with JsonSerializationException due to incorrect response deserialization (API returns wrapped object, SDK expected raw array)\n- Fixed: Decimal coordinates like \"50.5%\" threw ArgumentException in pt-BR locale due to culture-sensitive float parsing\n- Fixed: AddFileFromUrlAsync silently accepted HTTP error responses (404, 500) and uploaded invalid content as PDF\n\nFor full documentation, visit: https://docs.forsign.digital",
